WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Earthquakes strike every day, but current detection systems are expensive and not ubiquitous.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Imagine if washing machines or smart TVs had a tiny built-in sensor at no extra cost to you: together they could form a global network serving science!

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:45.000
This is QuakeGuard: ultra-small sensors embedded inside household appliances to detect earthquakes and alert us on our phones in real-time.

4
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
All of this is Open Source on GitHub. QuakeGuard: safety starts with everyday objects.